From a8bd7db90d4b0116d35ec8209839b1b4bc69d565 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?R=C3=A9my=20Hubscher?= <remy@yampa.ai>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 11:28:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Replace pkg_resources with importlib.resources.

Asset overrides now resolve through Pyramid's own APIs via explicit
IPackageOverrides registry lookup, removing the setuptools runtime
dependency and the OverrideProvider loader hook.
---
